\begin{abstract}
MLB--MACSE v4.0 is a unified hardware--software simulation architecture that
integrates MLB Statcast telemetry, astrophysical entropy sources, post-quantum
cryptography, and autonomous inference loops. This publication formalizes the
complete co-design specification, including enterprise hardware topology,
