\section{Autonomous Inference Loops}

The autonomous inference subsystem updates predictions using entropy-weighted
Bayesian inference:

\begin{equation}
\mathbf{I}_{\text{auto}}(t+\Delta t)
=
\mathbf{I}_{\text{auto}}(t)
+
\alpha \cdot \text{EntropyWeight}(\mathbf{E}_{\text{astro}})
\cdot \text{BayesUpdate}(S_{\text{MACSE}}(t))
\end{equation}

Where $\alpha$ is a learning-rate scalar derived from astrophysical entropy.

